  m_text: 'CYBER VOID

    A Game by JinYeol Yun



    -----------------------------



    Director
    / Game Design

    JinYeol Yun



    Programming

    JinYeol Yun

    with
    a little help from Stack Overflow



    Art & UI Design

    JinYeol Yun

    AI
    Brush Concept Support - "SYNTHFRAME"



    Sound & Music

    Main Theme - "Neon
    Pulse" by Analog Horizon

    SFX - Cyberpunk Audio Pack Vol.1

    Additional
    Mixing by JinYeol Yun



    Scenario & Writing

    JinYeol Yun

    ChatGPT
    (concept editing & localization support)



    Tools Used

    Unity Engine
    (2022 LTS)

    Visual Studio 2022

    Aseprite / Photoshop / 3ds Max

    Audacity
    / Reaper

    Steamworks SDK



    Special Thanks

    All playtesters

    Everyone
    who supported this project

    and You, the Player



    Publisher

    Self-Published
    on Steam



    -----------------------------



    "In the end, every glitch
    is just another form of light."'
